## API reference

[Open the API reference source](pages/api-reference.mdxl)

### `parse_training_log(text) -> list[tuple[int, float]]`

Return ``(step, loss)`` pairs parsed from ``hypernix.train`` stdout.

### `plot_loss_curve(pairs, out_path, title='Training loss') -> Path`

Save a loss curve as a PNG. Returns the path written.

### `plot_score_distribution(scores, out_path, title='Judge score distribution', bins=20) -> Path`

Histogram of judge scores (one pass through a dataset).

### `plot_round_losses(rounds, out_path, title='Multi-round training loss', round_labels=None) -> Path`

Plot loss curves for multiple training rounds (e.g. from :mod:`tupperware`).

